	(text "DETECT: the bed's ID resistor against this 10k (BED_1..6 =\n2.2k..33k), a removal (> 55000), a bed node's touch (> 56000,\nrising, armed, \"trigger\": \"detect\"). GP11: the probe pulse (10 ms),\nonly as long as the OR gate is there."
